  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yesu yeechesia khukokhukhola aketsimbabasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwiyile kahala, muleshe okhukholanga akobulunjishi keenywe imbeli wabandu mbu bamulole; muleshe okhubula omukabo okhurula khuSeenywe ouli mwikulu ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila, olwa okhola akeshisa orakhupa olwika imbeliwo shinga abeekaatii abo olwa bakholanga musinagogi khandi khumihanda, mbu mana baheebwe oluyali nende abandu, ta. Emuboolela toto, mbu bamalile okhunyoola omurungo kwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe olwa okhola akeshisa, orafuchiilila omukhonokwo mukhasi kumanye aka omukhonokwo musaatsa kukhola ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mana akeshisashio kabe akamabiswi; naye So oulolanga mumabiswi alakhurunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yesu yeechesia khubasaayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa musaaya, muraba shinga abeekaatii abo tawe; okhuba baheelanga okhusinjila nibasaba musinagogi kata mumasanganjila mbu mana abandu babalole. Emuboolela toto mbu bamalile okhunyoola omurungo kwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne iwe, olwa osaaya, yinjila mushisikashio eshiomukari, man nomalile okhwikala omuliango, omusabe So ou mumabiswi, naye So oulolanga mumabiswi alakhurunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi, olwa musaaya mureelakalakani butswa shinga abamahanga olwa bakhola, tawe; shichila bo bakaalanga mbu balahulilwa khulwa obunji bwamasungo kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho inywe mura fwananana ninabo ta; okhuba Seenywe amanyile ebia mutamba shinga olwa bili, nimurashiamusa ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, musaayenje muri nanwa, mbu E Seefwe, ouli mwikulu, Eliiralio liriibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwamibwo bwitse. Aka wenya keekhol mushialo, shinga olwa keekholanga mwikuhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuheelesie leelo ebiliibwa bieefwe bialeelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokhuleshela amakobi keefwe, shinga if we olwa khubalesheele abeekobi beefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Norakhuyila mukhuteemwa ta, ne okhuhonie mububi [Okhuba obwami, nende obunyali, nende oluyali, nebibio, ebisoni nebisoni. Amina.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila nimuba nimubaleshela nbandu obuyiiri bwabwe Seenywe owomwikulu naye alamuleshela inywe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nimuba nimurabaleshela abandu obuyiiri bwabwe ta, kata Seenywe shialamuleshela inywe obuyiiri bweenywe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yesu yeechesia khukokhuhonga inzala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi, olwa muba nimuhonga inzala, murakhuunia mumoni shinga abeekaatii abo ta; okhuba babiiyinjia mumoni mwabwe mbu abandu balole shinga olwa bahonga inzala. Emuboolela toto, mbu bamalile okhunyoola omurungo kwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne iwe, olwa ohonga inzala, wibashe amafura mumurwe niwiyosia mumoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu abandu baleshe okhulola shinga olwa ohonga inzala ta, habula So ouli mumabiswi; naye So oulolanga mumabiswi alakhurunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akobuyinda mwikulu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mureebiishila abeene amabiikho mushialo, aha amatsilili nende tsindebelende bisasinjia naha abeebi bayabanga nibeeba, ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa mwibiishile amabiikho mwikulu, aha amatsilili kata tsindebelende birasasinjia, kata abeebi okhuyaba nokhwiba ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shichila libiikholio aha lili, niho aha omwoyokwo nakwo kulabeetsanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Itaha yomubili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itaha yomubili niyo imoni; kho imoniyo niyiba niyili habwene, omubilikwo kwosi kuleetsulamwo obulafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne imoniyo niyiba niyili imbii, omubilikwo kwosi kuleetsulamwo eshiilima Kho obulafu obuli mwiwe nibuba nibuli eshiilima, kho eshiilima eshio shishiakhaba eshikhongo muno?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye nende emiandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulaho ounyala okhukhalabanila abaami babili ta; shichila alachwang'a mulala khubo namuheela oundi, kata mbu alahambaana nende mulala khubo namuchaya oundi. Shimunyala okhukhalabanila Nyasaye khandi nende emiandu ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila nimuboolela mbu Murahendelanga akobulamu bweenywe, ebia mwitsa okhuIia, kata ebia mwitsa okhunywa, ta; kata akemibili chieenywe, ebia mwitsa okhwifwala, tawe. Obulamu shibushila ebiliibwa, omubili nakwo shikushila ebiifwalo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole amanyonyi akokhwikulu, shinga olwa kararaakanga kata okhuchesa, kata okhukhung'aasia mubiachi ta; ne Seenywe owomwikulu akaliisinjia. Inywe shimukashila muno akeenako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niwina khwinywe, khulwa obuhendi obwa ahendanga, wakhanyala okhwimeetela kata isaa ndala khubuyindifubwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata nishiina eshichila nimuhendelanga ebiifwalo? Mwechele khumataanye akomubulimo, shinga olwa kakhulanga; shikanyakhananga emilimo, kata shikasiiranga obuusi ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa emuboolela mbu kata Sulemani mung'oonoye yosi shiyayeefwala shinga elala khuko ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Nyasaye olwa afwalanga obunyasi obwomubulimo ebiifwalo biabwo birio, obubaho leelo, ne mukamba busukunwa mumulilo, shialashila okhumufwala inywe, inywe abali nobusuubili obutuutu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, muleshe okhuhendanga, muri Nakhulie shilna? Kata mbu Nakhunywe shiina? Kata mbu Nakhwifwale shiina? Tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba bienebio biosi nibio ebia Abamahanga bakhaabanga; shichila Seenywe owomwikulu yamanye shinga olwa mukhoyile okhuba nebindu ebio biosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ranjilile mukhaabe obwamibwe nende obuIunjishibwe; nebindu bino biosi mulameetelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila, murahendelanga akomukamba tawe; okhuba inyanga yomukamba yilahendela akayo. Buli nyanga yibeetsanga namanyakhano kayo akachihela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
